sing C++ language and a self-made game engine. The content of TerraCraft is based on Minecraft and its well-known mod packages. For the official content of Minecraft, please refer to Mojang Studios and relevant mod authors\u2019 descriptions. If you like this fangame, just show your support to the best&nbsp;<em>Minecraft and Terraria</em>!&nbsp;</p><p>TerraCraft is the first 2D sandbox platform game which allow you to play on an&nbsp;<strong><em>INFINITE</em></strong>&nbsp;world in one map. TerraCraft uses a dynamic chunk technology similar to Minecraft, so every world you create is infinite. TerraCraft\u2019s unique portal system can save all your locations for teleportation, allowing you to explore more secrets of the unlimited world!</p>\r\n<p>The current version of TerraCraft implements infinite map width, and also implements the surface layer, the underground layer, and the nether layer. In future updates, more layers will be added to create a world of infinite height and infinite depth and make TerraCraft truly become an infinite world!<br>TerraCraft supports multiplayer mode, you can run the TerraCraftServer and play this game with your friends!</p><p><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY AT </strong><a href=\"http://tc.calvik.ml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><strong>TERRACRAFT OFFICIAL FORUM</strong></a></p><p><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD </strong><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5C2s9JE\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">HERE</a></strong></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5C2s9JE\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"></a><strong>CANNOT RUN THIS GAME? HOW TO PLAY WITH OTHERS?&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://tc.calvik.ml/d/31-faqs\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><strong>CHECK FAQs</strong></a></p>\r\n<p>The latest version is&nbsp;<strong></strong><strong>Indev 1.0 (January 27, 2021)</strong></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a clas